WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:11.179
Ben and the others watched as two emergency medical monsters loaded Mr. Bog into an ambulance.

2
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.321
Mr. Bog smiled.

3
00:00:14.322 --> 00:00:18.212
"Don't worry about me. I'm a tough old monster.

4
00:00:18.213 --> 00:00:22.297
I'll be back on the job before you know it!"

5
00:00:22.298 --> 00:00:26.652
Ben smiled and waved, but he was worried about the custodian.

6
00:00:26.653 --> 00:00:29.546
Everyone else was too.

7
00:00:29.547 --> 00:00:33.324
"I think his leg is broken," Cleo said.

8
00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:36.150
"How can you tell?" Winnie asked.

9
00:00:36.151 --> 00:00:39.787
"From the way his leg was wrapped," Cleo said.

10
00:00:39.788 --> 00:00:43.142
"We mummies know a lot about bandages."

11
00:00:43.143 --> 00:00:48.351
As the ambulance drove away, Mr. Freaky turned to the students.

12
00:00:48.352 --> 00:00:51.620
"It looks bad, but Mr. Bog will be fine.

13
00:00:51.621 --> 00:00:55.381
But while he's out, we must take care of our building.

14
00:00:55.382 --> 00:00:58.681
We also need to pay more attention to school safety.

15
00:00:58.682 --> 00:01:01.319
We've had too many accidents lately."

16
00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:10.150
Winnie grinned sheepishly. "We accidentally opened a vortex during Spell Club yesterday."

17
00:01:10.151 --> 00:01:15.786
"I fell in the parking lot sinkhole," Ozzy said. Then he shrugged.

18
00:01:15.787 --> 00:01:17.732
"That was actually fun though."

19
00:01:17.733 --> 00:01:20.727
Mr. Freaky's noses started to wiggle.

20
00:01:20.728 --> 00:01:24.510
"Oh dear. The safety problems are worse than I thought.

21
00:01:24.511 --> 00:01:31.264
If Mayor Hubbletree hears about any safety issues at our school, he might cancel the sleepover."

22
00:01:31.265 --> 00:01:38.785
Mr. Freaky blew his noses. "That will make our school look really bad."

23
00:01:38.786 --> 00:01:46.012
Jen gasped. "We can't let Mayor Hubbletree cancel the sleepover! What can we do?"

24
00:01:46.013 --> 00:01:50.259
Mr. Freaky shook his head. "I don't know."

25
00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:55.593
"I have an idea," Ben said. "Why don't we start a safety patrol?"

26
00:01:55.594 --> 00:01:59.496
"Huh?" Winnie asked. "What's that?"

27
00:01:59.497 --> 00:02:02.752
"There was a safety patrol at my last school," Ben said.

28
00:02:02.753 --> 00:02:07.141
"Students patrol the school and make sure everyone is following the rules."

29
00:02:07.142 --> 00:02:10.212
"That would be nice," Francis said.

30
00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:14.692
Mr. Freaky's eyes lit up. "Great idea, Ben.

31
00:02:14.693 --> 00:02:17.078
Now we need to figure out housekeeping.

32
00:02:17.079 --> 00:02:21.382
We must keep the school in tip-top shape while Mr. Bog is out."

33
00:02:21.383 --> 00:02:30.353
A dirt monster nodded. "Humans don't like messes." He snorted. "They're so weird."

34
00:02:30.354 --> 00:02:36.786
"Maybe some students can do Mr. Bog's job until he gets back on his feet," Winnie suggested.

35
00:02:36.787 --> 00:02:45.051
"Yes!" Mr. Freaky said. "Who'd like to scrub bathrooms and empty trash cans?"

36
00:02:45.052 --> 00:02:47.564
There was dead silence.

37
00:02:47.565 --> 00:02:50.552
"Anyone?" Mr. Freaky asked.

38
00:02:50.553 --> 00:02:54.349
The dirt monster shrugged. "I like filth."

39
00:02:54.350 --> 00:03:01.047
A fish monster nodded. "If we make the school too clean, it will lose its terrible smell."

40
00:03:01.048 --> 00:03:05.126
A garbage monster poked her head out of a nearby trash can.

41
00:03:05.127 --> 00:03:09.927
"Don't empty this trash can. I'm studying in here!"

42
00:03:09.928 --> 00:03:13.457
Mr. Freaky sighed.

43
00:03:13.458 --> 00:03:17.663
Cleo raised her hand. "Ben, Winnie, and I will do it.

44
00:03:17.664 --> 00:03:22.012
We're on the welcome committee, so we'll be cleaning anyway."

45
00:03:22.013 --> 00:03:27.723
"Perfect!" Mr. Freaky said. "Our sleepover is saved!"

46
00:03:27.724 --> 00:03:32.843
"Yay!" Some monsters, including Winnie, cheered.

47
00:03:32.844 --> 00:03:35.826
"Yay?" Ben muttered, glancing at her.

48
00:03:35.827 --> 00:03:39.447
"Didn't you just hear Cleo volunteer us for toilet scrubbing?"

49
00:03:39.448 --> 00:03:45.899
Winnie smiled. "It won't be so bad. We can get some other monsters to help us."

50
00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:49.565
"We'll see about that," Ben thought.

51
00:03:49.566 --> 00:03:56.645
At the end of the day, Mr. Freaky held an assembly to announce plans for the new monster safety patrol.

52
00:03:56.646 --> 00:03:59.346
Ben sat down next to Mog and Jen.

53
00:03:59.347 --> 00:04:05.979
"So, students," Mr. Freaky finished up, "if you want to volunteer for the new monster safety patrol,

54
00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:11.223
come to my office before school tomorrow morning for a special meeting.

55
00:04:11.224 --> 00:04:16.634
Being on safety patrol will be fun, but it's also very serious business.

56
00:04:16.635 --> 00:04:23.060
The safety of Monster Academy—and the success of the sleepover—depends on you!"

57
00:04:23.061 --> 00:04:25.317
Mog turned to Ben and Jen.

58
00:04:25.318 --> 00:04:30.670
"I'm definitely joining safety patrol," he said. "What about you guys?"

59
00:04:30.671 --> 00:04:33.370
"I'm joining too," Jen said.

60
00:04:33.371 --> 00:04:41.787
"I want to do everything I can to keep our school safe for the sleepover. Dave has to come."

61
00:04:41.788 --> 00:04:46.231
"I've got enough to do," Ben said with a sigh.

62
00:04:46.232 --> 00:04:49.949
"No monster safety patrol for me."

63
00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:55.179
Before heading home, Ben went to his locker to gather books for homework.

64
00:04:55.180 --> 00:05:02.249
When he headed back to the main entrance, he saw Mr. Freaky and the office ogre hanging up a new banner.

65
00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:07.870
It read: Number of Days Without a Safety Incident: 0.

66
00:05:07.871 --> 00:05:11.712
Mr. Freaky stood back to gaze proudly at his sign.

67
00:05:11.713 --> 00:05:16.854
"We'll update the banner every day. It will motivate our students."

68
00:05:16.855 --> 00:05:20.065
Just then someone burst in through the doors.

69
00:05:20.066 --> 00:05:24.405
"Freaky!" Mayor Hubbletree cried.

70
00:05:24.406 --> 00:05:29.720
"I just heard that your only custodian suffered a serious injury.

71
00:05:29.721 --> 00:05:36.791
I need your word that this school building is going to be safe for my citizens during Friday night's sleepover."

72
00:05:36.792 --> 00:05:43.088
Mr. Freaky's noses wiggled. "Everything is totally under control here, Mayor Hubbletree.

73
00:05:43.089 --> 00:05:47.179
You have my word that all the people will be safe."

74
00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.921
"Good," Mayor Hubbletree snapped.

75
00:05:49.922 --> 00:05:54.696
"Because I'll be inspecting your school on Wednesday with three parent chaperones.

76
00:05:54.697 --> 00:06:04.726
And if I spot any hazards, even one tiny little danger, there will be huge consequences!"

